    summary: "To find \"gmail.svg\" within `raw.githubusercontent.com` specifically related to \"simple-icons\", a search reveals that the Gmail icon is available as an SVG vector in the Simple Icons set[1]. It is often provided in various styles like Solid, Bold, and Glyph, and can be used with design tools like Sketch and Figma[1].\n\nWhile the direct raw.githubusercontent.com link for a \"simple-icons gmail.svg\" wasn\'t explicitly provided as a search result, other sources confirm the existence and availability of the Gmail SVG icon within the \"Simple Icons\" collection[1][2]. For example, Streamline offers a free download of the Gmail SVG from their Simple Icons collection[1]. Similarly, Dashboard Icons and Magnific (formerly Freepik) also provide free downloads of Gmail icons in SVG format, among others[3][4]. Wikimedia Commons also hosts a \"File:Gmail icon (2020).svg\"[5].\n\nSources:\n[1] [streamlinehq.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHppL03511c32LgPecHkilPIMAwBCQe4fVJ-b3F6F1XRz6-YJcDm2nDUt4juLJlhb1COfXGOvMqg_cbPs6i9BED6OuJ0ytrNGEwZ1u-RQgefa8XE7syFT96GSxaGnEz_Wj2NMCnHCqqQ5BL3-in6ZGir5g=)\n[2] [shadcn.io](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFq6CgA4D2ULG4Dz9bSQ1opq_GuFNVN3lsPuNVO1G_wb16gZGBr0rvAI8y2gJ0y6aD2cGWn5AbsB0kE0gCHdWvbRDn1QIzCPSa-C9Muk0EZQwM-lGM2NdDHg18cgIt2zzP62gmOxRHe)\n[3] [dashboardicons.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHiktD1V_nQh8m-Z-crHWz0yLdiihk0Z-8KUgFamP3Z23Fj-_yMCH56H_WcekTtDX4dRY4_djVUYzVz9wmOPTHHYtadIJ-EpaURbis8xKrXqKO7sHyfl0O-2cOqwcgpuU0=)\n[4] [magnific.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGlj0mTWoA3BMdE5qQaUFTDNnj0nm6ZmewYMu1R6nhTfKu0DnHTC9uSz2FWB2gK4EGgMffxpG97lpZWmmL0AhmJ3GRer0zRPm1Ga76EfO_aRvqewWxnPDoqhj0EXk56)\n[5] [wikimedia.org](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGl8Wt780gxeZNLGjoIcDpeSDlgeAaf8se-jNgdDC3aBTyD03l_kmrJiZMZRweBFbOH_nKYs7_AxmnG1-Ak7N