    summary: "The `content viewBox` for the \"File:Gmail_icon_(2020).svg\" is `0 0 512 384`[1][2][3].\n\nThe `viewBox` attribute defines the position and dimension of an SVG viewport in user space, with the four values representing `min-x`, `min-y`, `width`, and `height`[4][5][6][7]. In this case, `0 0` indicates that the SVG content starts at the coordinates (0,0), and `512 384` specifies the width and height of the viewable area, corresponding to the nominal dimensions of the original SVG file[1][2][3].\n\nSources:\n[1] [wikimedia.org](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHNB6uQlIqbHU1kez0upSzQIih7s9eG2YQBMpm8OAMluIEbCvIHQjBloU88qLqD8nbMQFn0qN0E1hH97W3hlyk9fr0ujBXI33q1ZKFega9ywnv3LQsmPR1KMjHCI-WVHw-DiS5EIw6GoWNFOe6puATymVxFlpdiDZ8=)\n[2] [wikipedia.org](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGiR15N-vbcTRTKq1Ch1NN5yrS9Z-8ewpVL1WtlZ-Z1jlImLHkVeu-wvC31l65dZ_qTAhwUmy8YHneOInpt_jssYmC7yeVk1sFf9z9clHCo9BDngfzGjl3l0W8kpeKj1GNy_P49UY80kbMMMJmOTPHrpV2m)\n[3] [wikipedia.org](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHgnxnDyG00fY1eYqdxXvqbjn18Erieq7ABtJI3penQYZezKTepdL0HypDFvyIkWTVC9XBtDXGcsRP4y1FHdtvGkWwFeJow_-nMtc8NGrr97CkhT25eHRnwqBKFKTfbWPtSaRrrK7wHiMjK0XSuL113qptv)\n[4] [mozilla.org](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH2YjprdPbv55VgA8YEFFdDaY8qn9O-kysnSVFrQmrmcNvjJh_mjWHZygITBF5XwAyOw1HJes9CAIEmQ-vvZPgrCDbp1aZTUnSsM9fq-B4Su9SZ-o7VblicyVUkZ7NUP0Ay_YOTkcEGbHw7wsOFDqYIDMYXQAfyCv8xm79LQlhJAfGZZ45qRRo=)\n[5] [tutsplus.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQECdopR3LpgJRXMJCZ40g4oN2bQY51cJrEatarL4wU6wLtApkAtaoag0kvHTxNmbI9u_s2iS4nU9NroaBs9w-qnvCNUtD51HhiaIxpdzpCvQPJQ-gK85iZ1_z_a9m2ogLdKclNYBEwRTmXzBirV599pJFZGj64QjJ_hJNj8ODF6ts8S0FQnMaJ6mUfR-w==)\n[6] [geeksforgeeks.org](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH0AzKk1azf8wD8N6JRo5HqzCzaIls-ciS5fjkQVStjmM9XzmgUAgr7vF4ZG6XEgIIkwNBIuT6IUBrRf0cBZU