    summary: "The string \"M24 5.457v13.909c0 .904-.732 1.636-1.636 1.636h-3.819V11.73\" is a segment of an SVG (Scalable Vector Graphics) path data, used to define shapes and lines in vector graphics. This type of string acts as a set of commands and parameters that instruct how to draw a path.[1][2][3]\n\nHere\'s a breakdown of the commands within the provided string:\n*   **M (moveto)**: The \"M\" command, followed by coordinates (e.g., `M24 5.457`), indicates the start of a new sub-path and moves the \"drawing pen\" to the specified absolute coordinates without drawing a line.[1][2][3] In this case, it moves to the point (24, 5.457).\n*   **v (vertical lineto)**: The lowercase \"v\" command (e.g., `v13.909`) draws a vertical line from the current point by the specified relative distance.[2][3] Here, it draws a vertical line downwards by 13.909 units.\n*   **c (cubic B\303\251zier curve)**: The lowercase \"c\" command (e.g., `c0 .904-.732 1.636-1.636 1.636`) draws a cubic B\303\251zier curve.[1][2][4] The parameters following \"c\" are control points and an end point, defining the shape of the curve relative to the current position.[1][4]\n*   **h (horizontal lineto)**: The lowercase \"h\" command (e.g., `h-3.819`) draws a horizontal line from the current point by the specified relative distance.[2][3] In this instance, it draws a horizontal line to the left by 3.819 units.\n*   **V (vertical lineto)**: The uppercase \"V\" command (e.g., `V11.73`) draws a vertical line from the current point to an absolute Y-coordinate.[2][3] This means the line will end at a Y-coordinate of 11.73, regardless of the current Y-position.\n\nSources:\n[1] [svgwg.org](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGUHqwNLXcjgAuJLzWoL7llaI2rEDBEE4rpMqxUW9jrX3GGN2P9hOB6siZJT9L45XYx5XdF00rLvcSBQLnexBqmXGIuqFav33zkgkaG8J8mwnJklsfpBGdZKA==)\n[2] [w3schools.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEewaou875aQNZcWZBeo2L44PY1dN2fvye5h2HPDLuXsmeHe6zOxkCV9V0vfjVdRaeCUCnWYvm4y7-ruphdTJCwWJCwLG4vXjSH1Pav_6qEvo9NB9jEUeQgSeHL6K-LLboHpDn37hiEwuAP)\n[3] [mozilla.org](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEDbwH5pWaYfyN0IZtJWiCAlGOq6iqxxX42KtPp0fscGSTpXaKNkEfp6-0RmRiBNP-4_wh0FB36k69kAjpHDvFcbmkZAITLpsutvb8lmBP6gkeSoPgfegtytzju0NSrxkW4MN0ZK_9uspqaxGMzM8VBse4jIpCD_etkNlKLbH4cCpHaNScw5tCBhHTFZQ==)\n[4] [w3.org](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFwPh7WxuB7n_UdorCkYUWNLOpHOGBhYUZZAK_gFMi53w_CTYz0dIACgq6DjHxV8G5wtlv9VB3_vGKDRMm8rv3V440bCUwM5tRFz9xkNL0KAAtmvwLs5tmOo-C0SsRZyQ==)"
