ks the tricolor bar/logo text, a menu (Workspace/Platform Info/Quick Switcher) appears with hover state and click to open. Also, a separate, explicit 3-dots button (`MoreVertical`/`MoreHorizontal`) resides in the sidebar header. I am investigating ASHIELDER\'s nature: a cybersecurity platform. I am looking at which actions should be listed in the sidebar 3-dots menu, such as Active Partition/Tenant: CDGI Enterprise SOC.\n\n\n**Identifying Missing Click**\n\nI\'m now deep-diving into the actual 3-dots button, or lack thereof! I\'ve discovered a \"MoreHorizontal\" button in `CaseTableRow.tsx` that *should* be the three-dots. The button had no click handler. It didn\'t do anything! And also, in `CaseDetailPage.tsx`, I found yet another 3-dots with similar missing function!\n\n\n"
