    response: "I have resolved the issue with the \"3 dots\" menu not opening and made the options popover fully interactive:\n\n- **Sidebar Workstation Options Menu**:\n  - Added a dedicated 3-dots action button (`MoreVertical`) in the sidebar header with hover and active states.\n  - Linked the 3-segment tricolor brand indicator to open the workstation actions popover on click as well.\n  - Implemented the options menu popover displaying workstation status (`v1.0.4`, `CDGI SOC Engine Active`), quick navigation shortcuts (Security Overview, New Investigation / Ingest, Threat Intelligence Hub, Evidence Vault), settings, and theme toggling.\n  - Added automatic dismissal on outside clicks and `Escape` key presses.\n\n- **System-Wide 3-Dots Interaction Support**:\n  - Connected the 3-dots action button across inbox case rows (`CaseTableRow`), overview incident tables (`SecurityOverviewPage`), and the case header (`CaseDetailPage`) so analysts can open workspace views, copy incident IDs/telemetry JSON, update verdicts, and export forensic packages."
    thinking: "**Confirming Focus Mode Instructions**\n\nI\'ve just verified the user selector for focus mode instructions. I\'ve pinpointed the relevant elements within the DOM structure. It looks like `div#root:nth-of-type(1) > div:nth-of-type(1) > aside#app-sidebar:nth-of-type(1) > div:nth-of-type(1) > div:nth-of-type(1) > div:nth-of-type(1) > div:nth...` is the correct path. Now I feel ready to delve further.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have resolved the issue with the \"3 dots\" menu not opening and made the options popover fully interactive:\n\n- **Sidebar Workstation Options Menu**:\n  - Added a dedicated 3-dots action button (`MoreVertical`) in the sidebar header with hover and active states.\n  - Linked the 3-segment tricolor brand indicator to open the workstation actions popover on click as well.\n  - Implemented the options menu popover displaying workstation status (`v1.0.4`, `CDGI SOC Engine Active`), quick navigation shortcuts (Security Overview, New Investigation / Ingest, Threat Intelligence Hub, Evidence Vault), settings, and theme toggling.\n  - Added automatic dismissal on outside clicks and `Escape` key presses.\n\n- **System-Wide 3-Dots Interaction Support**:\n  - Connected the 3-dots action button across inbox case rows (`CaseTableRow`), overview incident tables (`SecurityOverviewPage`), and the case header (`CaseDetailPage`) so analysts can open workspace views, copy incident IDs/telemetry JSON, update verdicts, and export forensic packages."
